    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43559" root="&#xA;                        مرن&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَنَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>It was,</i> or <i>became smooth,</i> (S, M, K,)
<i>with a degree of hardness.</i> (M, K.) Said of a
camel's foot: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْحَقَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَنَ عَلَى شَىْءٍ</span>
                        <i>He
became accustomed, habituated, or inured, to a
thing.</i> (K.)

